{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aren’t sampled again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"samplingDropReports","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","u